   $q$The word "video" comes from a Latin root meaning "I see." Based on this root, what is a "video call"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A call in which people can see each other","is_correct":true},{"text":"A call that is recorded to watch later","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"A call in which people can only hear voices","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-root-clues"},{"text":"A call made to a place that is nearby","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"context-only-guess"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A call in which people can see each other$q$, $q$The root means "see," and the passage shows Grandma's face filling the screen and Priya holding up a drawing to the camera. A call with only voices leaves out the seeing that the root names.$q$, 'draft', 'b30167b8-e836-5642-a884-a4c4479be157')
